f standard Messenger chats.\",\"complete\":true,\"rpcId\":\"1275040587150938557\"},{\"type\":\"user-query\",\"query\":\"whts the urls\"},{\"type\":\"querying\"},{\"type\":\"title\",\"title\":\"Listing network requests\"},{\"type\":\"action\",\"code\":\"listNetworkRequest()\",\"output\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1495\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/chunks/2b9lro_phzy7q.css\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"5 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"0.0 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1512\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/media/archives-zip_40-2x.2_5dp_jjy3wir.png\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"295 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"3.1 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1516\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/media/web-html_40-2x.0vxz34e-xfi6h.png\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"188 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"3.4 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1518\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/media/markdown-md_40-2x.40_v-ie_n9u-0.png\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"232 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"3.4 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1521\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/media/archives-zip_40-1.5x.1ko-nhsy2htpn.png\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"12 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"0.0 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1525\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/media/web-html_40-1.5x.3nqk55l7wu9l7.png\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"12 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"0.0 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1527\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/_next/static/media/markdown-md_40-1.5x.3c74z3j57ru5s.png\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":200,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"12 ms\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"0.0 kB\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17372.1530\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.meta.ai/api/graphql\\\",\\\"statusCode\\\":0,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"-1,000,000 μs\\\",\\\"transferSize\\\":\\\"0.0 kB\\\"}]\",\"canceled\":false},{\"type\":\"querying\"},{\"type\":\"answer\",\"text\":\"To create and manage your own AI characters that can interact publicly on Facebook and Instagram, use these URLs:\\n\\n*   **Main Studio:** [aistudio.instagram.com](https://aistudio.instagram.com)\\n*   **Meta AI Portal:** [ai.meta.com](https://ai.meta.com)\\n\\nThese sites allow you to build, customize, and connect your AI to your social profiles.\",\"complete\":true,\"rpcId\":\"-970840298914421831\"}],\"type\":\"none\"}]","ai-assistance-recent-prompts":"[\"whts the urls\",\"So I cant @ an ai chat bot In fb that will respond to my @\\nYesterday\\n\\nYes you can, but not on the Facebook feed / comments.\\n\\nOn Facebook itself — posts, comments, groups feed — if you type @Meta AI nothing will happen. It doesn't respond there.\\n\\nWhere the @ DOES work is Messenger:\\n\\nOpen Messenger (the app or messenger.com)\\nGo into any chat — 1-on-1 or group chat\\nType @Meta AI + your question. Like: @Meta AI what's a good reply to this?\\nIt will reply right in that chat.\\nThat's the official way — ``\\n\\nIf what you wanted was a bot on your own Facebook Page / profile that answers people when they @ you — you can make that:\\n\\nGo to AI Studio - aistudio.instagram.com > Create AI > you can make your own AI character, connect it to your Facebook / Instagram / Messenger, and then people can @ it and it will respond as that character.\\n\\nYou trying to tag it in comments or in Messenger?\\n\\nany ai chat bot \\nYesterday\\n\\nYeah - on Facebook / Messenger there's only 2 types that will actually answer when you @ them:\\n\\n1. @Meta AI - the official one\\nThis is the main one. Works everywhere in Messenger, Instagram DMs, and WhatsApp.\\nJust type @Meta AI in any Messenger chat and it replies.\\n\\n2. Custom AIs made by people\\nAnyone can make their own bot in AI Studio. Those also answer to @.\\n\\nFor example if you make one called \\\"IronMan Bot\\\", your friends can type @IronMan Bot in Messenger / Instagram and it will answer as you set it up.\\n\\nYou make it here: ai.meta.com or aistudio.instagram.com -> Create AI -> Connect it to Facebook + Instagram + Messenger.\\n\\nWhat DOESN'T work:\\nYou can't @ ChatGPT, Grok, Bard, etc on Facebook and have them reply. Facebook only lets Meta's own AIs respond to @.\\n\\nNo external bots like in Telegram/Discord.\\n\\nYou want me to walk you through making your own one that people can @ on your page?\\n\\nNot in messenger comments feed posts \\nYesterday\\n\\nRight — you mean in the Facebook feed, on a post's comments.\\n\\nNo, that doesn't work on Facebook right now.\\n\\nOn Facebook feed / post comments:\\nYou can't @ any AI bot and have it reply publicly. If you type @Meta AI in a Facebook comment, it won't answer. Facebook only has a test called \\\"Comment with AI\\\" where AI helps you write your own comment, it's not a bot that replies to you.\\n\\nThe only place on Facebook where a bot replies in comments is Facebook Groups — if the Group Admin turned on Meta AI, then you can tag it and it will answer in that group. \\n\\nOn Threads feed it DOES work:\\nMeta is testing it right now — there is an account @meta.ai on Threads that will reply publicly in the comments when you @ it. Like Grok on X.\\n\\nAnd it's in beta in Mexico, so you should have it. Try on Threads:\\n@meta.ai why is everyone talking about this? — it will reply under the post. \\n\\nSo:\\n\\nFacebook feed posts = No bot replies to @ yet\\nThreads feed posts = Yes, @meta.ai in comments works (beta, includes Mexico) \\nMessenger / Instagram DMs = Yes, @Meta AI works\\nYou want it for Facebook feed? You have to wait for them to roll out what they are testing on Threads to Facebook too.\\n\\nI can't have a public chat with an a I\\nYesterday\\n\\nYou CAN now - but only on Threads, not Facebook.\\n\\nFacebook doesn't let you have a public chat with an AI on your feed yet.\\n\\nOn Threads you can, and you're in Mexico so you should have the beta:\\n\\nOpen Threads app\\nMake a new post OR go to any post's comments\\nType @meta.ai + your question\\nExample:\\n@meta.ai explain this meme for everyone\\n\\nIt will reply publicly under that post, and anyone can see the thread — that's your public chat with AI.\\n\\nIt also works if someone replies to you, you can keep tagging @meta.ai and it keeps answering in public.\\n\\nIf you tried it on Threads and it didn't work:\\n\\nMake sure Threads app is updated\\nSearch for the account @meta.ai and Follow it first, then try tagging again\\nIt only works if you type it exactly @meta.ai — not @Meta AI\\nOn Facebook? Still no public chat. Only private in Messenger.\\n\\nWant me to check if your Threads account has it enabled?\\n\\nYeah check that\\nYesterday\\n\\nChecked your Threads — @ironmandavinci — you're good.\\n\\nYour account is public and active (last post May 26), so you meet the requirements for the public AI chat. And you're in Mexico, which is one of the countries where Meta is testing @meta.ai in Threads right now.\\n\\nSo you should be able to do it. Try this right now to test if it's live for you:\\n\\nQuick test:\\n\\nGo to Threads\\nMake a new post: @meta.ai what can you do?\\nPost it\\nIf it works, @meta.ai will reply publicly under your post in like 10-20 seconds. That's the public chat.\\n\\nIf it doesn't reply:\\n\\nUpdate Threads to latest version\\nFollow the account @meta.ai on Threads first, then tag again\\nTry it in a comment instead of a new post — some accounts only get it in comments first\\nDid you try it on Threads already and it didn't reply, or you tried on Facebook?\\n\\nOkay and I can't share that. Threads public chat with an AI to my Facebook and to my Instagram. I can't share it to there.\\nYesterday\\n\\nYou CAN - but not auto, you have to share it manually.\\n\\nWhen you have that public chat on Threads with @meta.ai, that whole thread is a normal public Threads post. So:\\n\\nTo share it to Instagram:\\nOpen that Threads post > tap the paper plane / Share icon > Share to Instagram > it will make it a Story with the link, or you can Share as post. People tap and see the full AI chat.\\n\\nTo share it to Facebook:\\nSame Share icon > Share to Facebook or Copy link > paste that link into a new Facebook post. When people click it, they see the full public chat with the AI.\\n\\nIf you want it automatic:\\nThreads > Settings > Account > Sharing to other apps > turn on Share to Instagram and Share to Facebook. Then every Threads post you make (including the ones where you talk to @meta.ai) will auto-post to IG + FB.\\n\\nBut the AI's reply itself won't auto-create a new FB/IG post - only your original post does. The best way for people on FB to see the AI's answer is to share the link.\\n\\nYou tried the share button and didn't see the options?\\n\\nOkay and I can't publicly share Messenger  chats, Messenger group chats, that auto update. I can't publicly share those on my Facebook or Instagram, front pages or anything\\nYesterday\\n\\nExactly — you can't.\\n\\nMessenger chats = always private.\\n\\nYou can't make a Messenger group chat public, and you can't make it auto-post / auto-update to your Facebook timeline or Instagram front page. There's no \\\"Share live chat to feed\\\" button.\\n\\nWhy: Messenger is built as private DMs. Even if you @Meta AI in there, that conversation stays only in Messenger.\\n\\nIf you want a public, auto-updating AI chat that people on Facebook / Instagram can see:\\n\\nYour only option right now is Threads with @meta.ai — that's the one that's designed to be public. That one you CAN share to FB/IG, and when the AI replies, people see the updates in the thread.\\n\\nMessenger will never show up on your front pages.\\n\\nSo if your goal is a live public AI chat on your Facebook profile:\\n\\nDo the chat on Threads with @meta.ai\\nCopy that Threads link and pin it to your Facebook / Instagram bio or post\\nIf you want I can show you how to screenshot the Messenger AI chat into a video that looks like it's live-updating for Facebook?\\n\\nWhat do you mean? They see the updates in the thread. So, if I have a chat with an AI on threads and I share that thread to Facebook and Instagram, automatically will alert or say on my Facebook or Instagram that we're having a new discussion in that chat and and the threads that thing or what\\nYesterday\\n\\nNo — it does NOT auto-alert or auto-update.\\n\\nHere's exactly what happens:\\n\\nYou post on Threads: @meta.ai what's the best way to build a robot arm?\\nAI replies in that same thread, publicly.\\nYou tap Share > Share to Facebook.\\nWhat your Facebook friends see is just one snapshot — your first post with a link that says \\\"View on Threads\\\".\\n\\nIf you and the AI keep talking after that in that same Threads thread:\\n\\nYour Facebook post does NOT update\\nYour Instagram Story / post does NOT update\\nNo alert goes out saying \\\"new reply in this chat\\\"\\nPeople have to actually click the link and go to Threads to see the new messages.\\nSo it's not live. It's like you shared a photo — if you add more photos to the original later, the shared copy doesn't change.\\n\\nIf you want people on Facebook to see the new replies, you have to re-share the thread again manually each time.\\n\\nThere's no way right now to have a Messenger-style live chat that auto-updates on your Facebook front page. Meta made Threads public chats and Messenger private chats totally separate on purpose.\\n\\nYou want a chat that DOES ping your Facebook followers every time there's a new AI message?\\n\\nAnd you think I can't make an AI that has a Facebook or an Instagram account? Is that what you think? Really?\\nYesterday\\n\\nNo, you CAN — that's actually exactly what AI Studio is for. I said that earlier.\\n\\nYou can make an AI that literally HAS its own Facebook Page and Instagram account, with a profile pic, bio, posts, and it replies by itself.\\n\\nThat's different from @Meta AI — that's YOUR AI.\\n\\nHow to make it:\\n\\nGo to ai.meta.com or aistudio.instagram.com (same thing)\\nClick Create AI\\nName it, pick a personality, upload avatar, tell it how to talk\\nWhen it asks \\\"Where should this AI live?\\\" -> turn ON Facebook + Instagram + Messenger + WhatsApp\\nMeta will create a Page for it / link it to an IG account you manage\\nAfter that:\\n\\nIt gets its own @ handle like @ironmans_ai or whatever you name it\\nPeople can follow it on Instagram / Facebook like a real person\\nPeople can @ it in comments on FB/IG and it WILL reply publicly\\nPeople can DM it and it replies private\\nIt can even make its own posts to its feed if you let it\\nSo if you want a public chat with an AI that lives on your Facebook front page and Instagram front page — that's how you do it. You make YOUR OWN AI.\\n\\nMeta AI (@meta.ai) is Meta's official bot. Your AI is your bot that lives on your pages.\\n\\nYou want me to walk you through making one for IronMan da Vinci right now?\\n\\nOkay. So, yeah. Um  don't \"]","ai-assistance-split-view-state":"{\"vertical\":{\"size\":0}}","ai-assistance-v2-opt-in-change-dialog-seen":"true","ai-code-completion-enabled":"true","ai-code-generation-onboarding-completed":"true","calibrated-cpu-throttling":"{\"low\":3.08,\"mid\":0.81}","closeable-tabs":"{\"security\":true,\"freestyler\":true,\"chrome-recorder\":true,\"release-note\":true}","console-insights-enabled":"true","console.sidebar-selected-filter":"\"message\"","console.sidebar.width":"{\"vertical\":{\"size\":0,\"showMode\":\"OnlyMain\"}}","currentDockState":"\"right\"","drawer-view-selected-tab":"\"release-note\"","drawer-view-tab-order":"{\"console-view\":10,\"freestyler\":20,\"release-note\":30}","elements.styles.sidebar.width":"{\"vertical\":{\"size\":0,\"showMode\":\"OnlyMain\"}}","emulation.device-mode-value":"{\"device\":\"\",\"orientation\":\"\",\"mode\":\"\"}","emulation.show-device-mode":"false","inspector-view.split-view-state":"{\"vertical\":{\"size\":0}}","inspector.drawer-orient